{"id":"because-so-that","lv":"b1","n":38,"cat":"clauses","t":"Because vs because of; so that, in order to","en":"because (of) · as · so that · in order to","sum":"Lý do: because + mệnh đề (because it was raining); because of + danh từ (because of the rain) — người Việt hay quên of. As / since + mệnh đề = vì, hơi trang trọng, hay đứng đầu câu (Since it's Saturday, the roads will be busy). Mục đích: to V; in order to V (trang trọng); so that + mệnh đề, thường với can / could / will / would (so that we can get good seats; so that I wouldn't forget). “Vì… nên…” chỉ dùng một từ.","forms":[{"f":"because + mệnh đề · because of + danh từ","vi":"because it rained · because of the rain"},{"f":"as / since + mệnh đề = vì","vi":"Since it's late, let's go."},{"f":"so that + chủ ngữ + can / could / will","vi":"so that we can get good seats"},{"f":"in order to + V (trang trọng)","vi":"in order to avoid the traffic"}],"pts":[{"id":"because-of","name":"because vs because of","vi":"Because + mệnh đề, because of + danh từ"},{"id":"as-since-reason","name":"as / since (reason)","vi":"As, since chỉ lý do"},{"id":"so-that-in-order-to","name":"so that / in order to","vi":"Chỉ mục đích: in order to, so that, so as not to"}],"cast":{"lily":{"name":{"en":"Lily","vi":"Lily"},"look":"girl","x":560},"dad":{"name":{"en":"Dad","vi":"Bố"},"look":"dad","x":1040}},"bg":"car","beats":[{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Dad, why are we leaving so early?","vi":"Bố ơi, sao mình đi sớm thế ạ?","ipa":["dæd","waɪ","ɑɹ","wi","ˈlivɪŋ","soʊ","ˈɝli"],"who":"lily","ann":{"expression":"tired"},"b":1,"start":0.454,"end":2.984,"timing":[[0,0.454],[1,1.118],[2,1.457],[3,1.613],[4,1.756],[5,2.225],[6,2.538]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Because of the traffic. And we want to get there early so that we can get good seats.","vi":"Vì tắc đường. Mà mình muốn đến sớm để có chỗ ngồi đẹp.","ipa":["bɪˈkɔz","ʌv","ðə","ˈtɹæfɪk","ənd","wi","wɑnt","tu","ɡɛt","ðɛɹ","ˈɝli","soʊ","ðæt","wi","kæn","ɡɛt","ɡʊd","sits"],"who":"dad","ann":{"ges